; The Phase 6 baseline opponent population. These are Tier 3 policies in the sense
; of docs/ocaml_migration_decisions.md — research-only opponents, never shipped —
; so they are written directly against Model.policy rather than encoded in the DSL,
; whose game seam is a one-tile/one-worker slice (docs/evaluation_protocol.md).
;
; The library depends on kag_model and nothing else: a baseline is a pure function
; of the observation, and owns no files, no threads, and no CLI.

